sequenceDiagram
    actor       Customer
    participant FE  as React Frontend
    participant MW  as Middleware
    participant CC  as Claim Controller
    participant FS  as Fraud Service
    participant SS  as Socket Service
    participant DB  as MongoDB

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Customer,DB: Phase 1 — Claim Submission
        Customer ->> FE  : Fill form + attach evidence files
        FE       ->> MW  : POST /api/claims  (JWT Bearer)
        MW       ->> CC  : submitClaim()
        CC       ->> DB  : Upload files → verify policy → save Claim
        DB      -->> CC  : Saved Claim (CLM-2026-XXXXXX)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 237, 213)
        Note over CC,DB: Phase 2 — Fraud Detection  (7 Rules)
        CC  ->>  FS : runFraudChecks(claim, policy)
        par Async DB checks
            FS ->> DB : Frequency, duplicate date, pending claims
        end
        FS  ->>  FS : Sync checks — expiry, wait period, high amount, coverage
        FS -->>  CC : { riskScore, isFlagged, triggeredRules }
        CC  ->>  DB : Save FraudLog + update Claim
        alt riskScore ≥ 40
            CC ->> SS : emitToRole("admin", fraud:flagged)
            SS -->> FE: Admin notified in real-time
        end
    end

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
        Note over CC,Customer: Phase 3 — Submission Confirmation
        CC  ->>  SS : notify(customer, CLAIM_SUBMITTED)
        SS -->>  FE : notification:new → dropdown updates
        FE -->> Customer : Toast — "Claim submitted successfully!"
    end

    rect rgb(243, 232, 255)
        Note over Adjuster,DB: Phase 4 — Adjuster Review
        actor Adjuster
        Adjuster ->> FE : Open claim queue
        FE       ->> MW : GET /api/claims/adjuster/queue  (JWT)
        MW       ->> CC : getAdjusterQueue()
        CC       ->> DB : Find assigned under-review claims
        DB      -->> FE : Claims list with risk scores
        Adjuster ->> FE : Approve claim + add note
        FE       ->> MW : PATCH /api/claims/:id/review
        MW       ->> CC : reviewClaim()
        CC       ->> DB : Update status + deduct coverage amount
        CC       ->> SS : notify(customer, CLAIM_APPROVED)
        SS      -->> FE : Customer notified in real-time
    end
